{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And the sense of יהיה בית אלהים.</b> A fixed place for my prayer and to render tithe from all that You give me — wealth — to give it to one who is worthy to receive it, for the honor of HaShem. And 'Levi as the tenth' is by way of derash, for there is no [law] in the Torah that a person tithe his sons — only tithe of cattle and flocks and produce."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:11.558512171Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}